# Personal files. The public template never contains them. In your private
# copy, add them once with `git add -f` (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, step 3); the
# scheduled workflow force-adds state/ after every run.
config/profile.yml
config/portals.yml
config/cv.md
config/blacklist.md
state/*
!state/.gitkeep

# Runtime output
output/
*.log
